on exitFrame me
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 1 ............................ <the frame>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [  6] extcall 2 ............................... go(the frame)
  [  8] ret
end

on mouseUp
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"MenuScreen">
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"MenuScreen">
  [  4] extcall 2 ............................... go("MenuScreen")
  [  6] ret
end
